{
  "kanji": "楽",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 楽\ntitle: music, enjoyment, ease\njlpt: 4\ntags: [jlpt-n4, grade-2, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 13\nradical: 木\nradicalNumber: 75\nonyomi: [ガク, ラク, ゴウ]\nkunyomi: [たの.しい, たの.しむ, この.む]\ndistractors: [業, 学, 東]\n---\n\n# 楽 — music, enjoyment, ease\n\n**Strokes:** 13 · **Key (radical):** 木 (no. 75) · **JLPT:** N4 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n楽 connects vocabulary about music, enjoyment, and ease. The reading helps distinguish 音楽 おんがく, \"music,\" 楽 らく, \"easy; comfortable,\" and [楽しい](../words/楽しい.md) たのしい, \"enjoyable.\"\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic:** imagine the [白](白.md)-shaped center and surrounding short strokes as a lively musical instrument above a [木](木.md) stand. This is a modern memory aid, not a verified origin story.\n\n## Readings\n\nThis table is selective; the metadata also preserves ゴウ and この.む.\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ガク | on | 音楽 おんがく (music) |\n| ラク | on | 楽 らく (ease; easy, comfortable) |\n| たの.しい | kun | [楽しい](../words/楽しい.md) たのしい (fun, enjoyable) |\n| たの.しむ | kun | 楽しむ たのしむ (to enjoy) |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [楽しい](../words/楽しい.md) たのしい — enjoyable, fun\n- 音楽 おんがく — music\n- 楽 らく — ease; easy, comfortable\n- 楽しむ たのしむ — to enjoy\n\n## Notes\n\n楽な仕事 らくなしごと is an easy job; 楽しい仕事 たのしいしごと is an enjoyable job. Ease and enjoyment need not coincide.\n[学](学.md) also has the reading ガク, but has 子 below, not 木. [業](業.md) has no 白-shaped box. In 音楽, [音](音.md) contributes \"sound.\"\n",
